# Leave empty to call the API on the same origin.
# - Local dev: Vite proxies /api and /health to http://localhost:8000.
# - Vercel: vercel.json proxies /api, /health, and /openapi.json to the backend.
# Do not set this to the HTTP backend URL in production; an HTTPS page cannot
# call an HTTP backend (mixed content).
VITE_API_URL=
